  "description": "Suddenly, the world has become a sweet potato field.  \nA world overflowing with people who are completely blocked, people who cannot communicate, people who do not communicate common sense...  \nI don't want to hurt you, but in this world where caring people are treated as fools, something is firmly wrong!  \nFor a world where the nicer people can live without saying anything, the refreshing hero ‘Cider Girl’ comes with a mysterious cider.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=800333), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8881204)",
